    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "After [REDACTED] and revisiting a nearby Floran tribe, I discovered a surprising trend that had arisen in tribal tradition. They have taken to calling their [REDACTED] 'Greenfingers.' It apparently was not limited to that one tribe either. Tribes all over the planet - and as I shortly learned, nearly every other tribe across this sector - have also taken up the practice.",
    "value": "在[已编辑]并重访了一个邻近的叶族部落后，我察觉到一个令人惊奇的趋势已在部落传统中形成：他们已习惯于将其[已编辑]称为“绿手指”。显然，这并非该部落独有的现象。遍布此星球的部落 - 正如我不久后所了解的，几乎本星区所有其他部落 - 也都沿用了这一做法。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "I am not certain if the tradition was undertaken as some long-forgotten form of flattery or simply because they associate my name with being clever, after these long [REDACTED]. Either way, I cannot say I am entirely displeased with the practice. It would seem I have left a lasting mark upon the history of my people.",
    "value": "我不确定这一传统是源于某种早已被遗忘的奉承形式，还是仅仅因为他们在漫长的[已编辑]之后，将我的名字与智慧联系在了一起。无论如何，我不能说自己对此做法全然不满。看来我已在族人的历史上留下了永久的印记。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "The tribal role of Greenfinger appears to be distinct from that of Tribesmaster, although exceptional Florans might occasionally be both. Greenfingers seem to serve as exceptionally clever, technically proficient shamen, and I have even seen evidence that they correspond with one another, acting almost as tribal envoys.",
    "value": "“绿手指”这一部落角色似乎与部落首领截然不同，尽管杰出的叶族人偶尔能身兼二职。绿手指们似乎扮演着异常聪明、技术娴熟的萨满角色，我甚至观察到证据表明他们彼此之间存在通信，几乎充当着部落间的使节。"
